1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,766
We are team MIAUTECH: Jimmy, Mary and Anderson.

2
00:00:03,816 --> 00:00:08,515
Our challenge: find places on Earth that behave like the Moon and Mars base sites.

3
00:00:08,565 --> 00:00:10,035
This is Earth Analogs.

4
00:00:10,085 --> 00:00:18,556
Pick a base and a mission. NASA data compares 15 features, and the ship lands on Earth's best twin: why it matches, and what it can't simulate.

5
00:00:18,606 --> 00:00:22,355
It also shows where NASA already trains, and untapped sites nobody uses yet.

6
00:00:22,405 --> 00:00:25,763
Open and free, so tomorrow's crews can rehearse the Moon and Mars, here on Earth.
